<title>FINLAND: MOST HELIBOR RATES MIXED AT FIX.</title>
<headline>MOST HELIBOR RATES MIXED AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helibor rates were mixed at the</p>
<p>Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Monday. The three-month rate</p>
<p>fell to 3.07 percent.</p>
<p>					   May 19 fix	   May 16 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor			  3.00 pct		3.00 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor			  3.03 pct		3.04 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor			  3.07 pct		3.08 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor			  3.18 pct		3.18 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor			  3.27 pct		3.28 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor			 3.38 pct		3.37 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
